# Narrator: Castle Ravenloft, the Court of the Count and the Rooms of Weeping (docs/voice/narrator.md;
# docs/regions/castle_ravenloft_court.md). Second person, present tense, one or two sentences.
# Book props (the unsent letters, the count's ledger, Rahadin's list of names) show their own text. The portrait in
# the long hall opens a conversation instead.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The maps

~ enter:castle_ravenloft_court
| The grand stairs end in a landing of black marble. Beyond it a long hall runs away in both directions under banners nobody has dusted in a lifetime.
| [night] Candles burn in the long hall with nobody to light them, and every flame leans the same way, toward the throne room doors.
| [guest:gertruda] Gertruda keeps a hand on somebody's sleeve all the way along the hall, and hums under her breath.
cooldown 20

~ enter:castle_ravenloft_court_weeping
| The stairs bring you up into a corridor of closed doors. Somewhere along it, always just out of sight, someone is crying very quietly.
| [flag.anastrasya_at_rest] The corridor is quiet. For the first time, nobody is crying behind any of the doors.
cooldown 20

~ enter:castle_ravenloft_court_treasury
| The stair turns twice in the thickness of the wall and lets you out into a low vault that glitters. The air tastes of cold metal.
cooldown 20

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Court of the Count

~ enter:court_grand_landing
| A landing wide enough for a carriage, and two suits of black armour with wolf-headed helms standing guard over nothing.
| [guest:gertruda and not flag.rahadin_stood_aside and not flag.rahadin_defeated] The landing is very still. Somebody is standing at the head of the stairs.
cooldown 20

~ enter:court_kings_hall
| The long hall runs the width of the keep under a vaulted ceiling. Every banner on its walls bears the same black crest, and every one has faded to the colour of old blood.
| [flag.rahadin_met] Your footsteps come back from the vault overhead a little late, as if the hall were checking them.
cooldown 15

~ enter:court_audience_hall
| A throne room built for crowds and kept for one. The throne stands on a dais at the far end, and the floor between is worn smooth by people who were made to walk it slowly.
| [treasure_at:castle_ravenloft_audience_hall] Something about the throne catches the light wrongly, the way a seat does when someone has only just left it.
cooldown 15

~ enter:court_study
| Books to the ceiling, a fire burning low, two armchairs turned toward it. Above the mantel a young woman in a painted frame looks down at the room.
| [treasure_at:castle_ravenloft_study] The painted woman's eyes are lowered, as if to something just below her frame.
cooldown 15

~ enter:court_trophy_room
| Heads on every wall: stags, bears, wolves, and things you don't have names for. At the far end, mounted like the rest, the long skull of a dragon.
once

~ enter:court_accountant
| A small office that smells of ink and tallow. Ledgers fill the shelves, the floor and most of the desk. The rest of the desk is an old man.
| [flag.lief_freed] The desk is empty. A broken shackle lies on the floor beside a neat stack of ledgers, squared off at the corners.
cooldown 15

~ enter:court_guard_post
| A guardroom with a cold hearth and a table set for a game of cards nobody finished. The pegs along the wall hold armour, and none of it is hanging quite still.
| [flag.court_post_cleared] Scattered armour lies across the guardroom floor, empty and quiet at last.
cooldown 20

~ enter:court_stair_hall
| A stair hall at the foot of a tower. One stair winds up into the dark toward the spires; another climbs to the floor above, toward the sound of someone crying.
once

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Rooms of Weeping

~ enter:court_weeping_hall
| Closed doors on both sides, and a long carpet that swallows your footsteps. The crying is always one door further on.
once

~ enter:court_weeping_landing
| The head of the stair, and a candle that never seems to burn down.
once

~ enter:court_strahds_bedchamber
| A great bed hung with black curtains, a cold hearth, a tall mirror. The bed has not been slept in for a very long time. The mirror shows it perfectly.
once

~ enter:court_strahds_bath
| A copper bath on clawed feet, a cabinet of bottles, a mirror fogged with dust. Someone kept up the appearances here long after there was any point.
once

~ enter:court_portrait_gallery
| A long gallery of dark portraits. At its heart hangs the master of the house himself, painted life-sized, and his eyes are already on the door.
| [flag.court_gallery_cleared] The gallery is quiet. Where the count's portrait hung there is a slashed frame and a paler patch of wall.
cooldown 20

~ enter:court_lounge
| A lounge of faded velvet and guttering candles. Three women in old-fashioned gowns look up together, like cats at a sound in the wall.
| [flag.court_brides_fought] The lounge is empty. A book lies open on a chair; cards lie in a ring of patience with no queens in it.
cooldown 20

~ enter:court_ludmilla_room
| Books in neat stacks, a coffin with a reading lamp beside it, and no mirror anywhere.
once

~ enter:court_anastrasya_room
| A bare little room with a coffin in it, and on the coffin's lid a child's drawing of a town on a hill, pinned flat with a hairpin.
once

~ enter:court_volenta_room
| Dolls with their eyes picked out, ranged along a shelf to watch the coffin. Someone has drawn smiles on all of them in red.
once

~ enter:court_guest_room
| A yellow room with a curtained bed, a dressing table and a wardrobe of gowns. Everything in it is very pretty and none of it is hers.
| [flag.gertruda_home] The yellow room is empty, and the wardrobe door hangs open on gowns that will never fit anyone again.
cooldown 20

~ enter:court_rahadin_chamber
| A cot, a rack of curved swords, a ledger on a stand, and nothing else. The screaming is loudest in here, the way a hive is loudest near the queen.
| [flag.rahadin_defeated] The room is silent. Whatever followed Rahadin about has gone with him.
cooldown 20

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The vault

~ enter:court_vault_stair
| The stair is so narrow your shoulders brush both walls. At the bottom, something glitters.
once

~ enter:court_treasury
| Coin lies on the vault floor in drifts, with chests and caskets sunk in it like rocks in snow. Centuries of tithes, and not one of them spent.
| [treasure_at:castle_ravenloft_treasury] Down in the deepest drift of coin, something that isn't money is catching your lantern light.
cooldown 15

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Things to look at

~ examine:court_study_hearth
| The fire burns low and gives no warmth at all. Above it, the young woman in her frame looks down at it as she has for a very long time.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_zarovich_crest
| The Zarovich crest, carved and gilded: a black bird on a field of red, wings spread over the throne as if to keep it.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_audience_window_w
| Far below the window the valley lies under its mist like something drowned. You can see the road you came up.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_dragon_skull
| A dragon's skull, silver-grey and longer than a man is tall, mounted on the wall among the stags. A brass plate under it gives a date and no name.
| [flag.argynvost_skull_known] Argynvost. The dragon of the ruined house on the ridge. His knights are still waiting for this to come home.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_trophy_heads
| A stag with antlers like a winter tree, a bear with its lips pulled back, a wolf larger than any wolf. Every plate gives the same hunter's name.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_general_statue
| A young general in old-fashioned armour, one hand on his sword, looking east toward the pass. The face is unmistakably the count's, and almost kind.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_hall_banners
| Old war banners, black birds on red, rotted to lace at the edges. Their battles were won before your great-grandparents were born.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_lief_desk
| A clerk's desk with a groove worn into the floor around it in a half circle: exactly the length of the chain.
| [flag.lief_freed] The chain lies slack on the floor. The groove around the desk will take a hundred years to fill in.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_stair_window
| A narrow window onto the courtyard far below, where the mist moves in slow circles like water round a drain.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_treasury_heaps
| Coin from every reign the valley ever had, and some it didn't. Most of it has never been touched by anyone but a tax collector.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_vault_chair
| A high-backed chair half sunk in the drifts of coin. The seat is worn smooth. He comes down here to sit.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_strahd_bed
| The bed is made. It has been made for a very long time. Nobody sleeps in it; he only likes to have it.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_strahd_mirror
| The mirror shows the room behind you in perfect detail: the bed, the hearth, the door, and you. The count stood here every morning for centuries and saw none of that.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_bedside_portrait
| A small portrait by the bed, the same young woman again, painted smaller, as if to be held in one hand.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_bath_tub
| A copper bath on clawed feet, bone dry. A bar of soap in the dish has gone hard as stone.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_strahd_portrait
| The count, life-sized, in black, one hand on a chair back. The painter caught him smiling. The paint has caught him watching.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_lounge_harpsichord
| A harpsichord with every key worn pale. Someone here plays it every night, the same piece, over and over.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_lounge_cards
| A game of patience laid out with no queens in the deck. It can never come out. It has been laid out a great many times.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_ludmilla_coffin
| A plain black coffin with a reading lamp on its lid and a ribbon marking somebody's place in a book.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_anastrasya_coffin
| A child's drawing on the lid: a walled town on a hill, a pool, a tree. Underneath, in a careful round hand, "Krezk".
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_volenta_coffin
| The lid is scratched all over with little tally marks, hundreds of them, in neat groups of five.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_guest_dressing_table
| Combs, ribbons, a pot of rouge, a hand mirror lying face down. Somebody turned it over and didn't want to turn it back.
cooldown 5

~ examine:court_guest_window
| The window looks out over the valley toward the village far below. From up here you could just make out a house with all its shutters closed.
cooldown 5

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Opening things

~ open:court_throne
| The seat of the throne lifts on a hidden hinge. Underneath is a shallow box lined with red velvet.
| [treasure_at:castle_ravenloft_audience_hall] The seat lifts on a hidden hinge. In the velvet box underneath, something has been waiting for you.
cooldown 5

~ open:court_study_portrait
| You follow her painted gaze to the bottom of the frame, and the frame comes away from the wall a little at the corner.
| [treasure_at:castle_ravenloft_study] You follow her painted gaze to the bottom of the frame. Something is wedged behind the canvas, exactly where she is looking.
cooldown 5

~ open:court_treasury_hoard
| You dig into the drift of coin up to the elbow. It is very cold.
| [treasure_at:castle_ravenloft_treasury] You dig into the drift of coin up to the elbow, and your fingers close on something that isn't money.
cooldown 5

~ open:court_strahd_jewel_box
| Rings, pins and a lady's hair comb, every one of them old-fashioned and every one of them small.
once

~ open:court_guest_wardrobe
| Three gowns, all the same size. Behind them, pushed to the back, a fourth in the same size with a stain at the collar.
once

~ open:court_anastrasya_trunk
| A plain dress, a shawl and a handful of copper coins from Krezk. Everything she came with.
once

~ open:court_trophy_cabinet
| A hunter's cabinet: a spear with a silver-chased head, a good bow, and a purse of prize money.
once

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Traps

~ trap:court_trophy_crossbow:found
| A tripwire runs knee-high across the floor in front of the trophy cabinet, to a hunting crossbow on the wall above it.
once

~ trap:court_trophy_crossbow:triggered
| The crossbow on the wall swings round on its bracket and looses into the room.
cooldown 1

~ trap:court_vault_glyph:found
| A sigil is cut into the bottom step, filled with something that is not quite silver. Nobody should stand on it.
once

~ trap:court_vault_glyph:triggered
| The sigil on the bottom step wakes in white fire, and the stairwell fills with lightning.
cooldown 1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Resting

~ rest:long:castle_ravenloft_court
| You sleep in shifts in a locked room off the long hall. Twice in the night footsteps stop outside the door, and wait, and go away.

# --- Hidden finds (docs/story/found_magic_items.md) ---

~ search:count_desk_ball
| The count's desk has a drawer no servant was meant to find. In it, on a cushion of black velvet, a crystal sphere with a mist moving slowly inside it.
once

~ check:investigation:count_desk_ball:failure
| Letters in an old, beautiful hand, all to the same woman, none of them sent. The desk keeps its other secrets.

~ search:trophy_dragon_slayer
| Above the dragon's skull, as if to remind it, hangs the sword that killed it. Its blade is dull blue and runs cold when you hold it near the bones.
once

~ search:mirror_cloak
| The tall mirror shows the room and not you. Behind it, in a narrow space against the wall, hangs a cloak whose edges never seem to be quite where you look.
once

~ check:investigation:mirror_cloak:failure
| The mirror shows an empty room. You don't like what that says about the room.

~ search:ludmilla_grimoire
| Among Ludmilla's books is a grimoire bound in grey leather, its margins full of her notes. The spells in it feel stronger just for being read.
once
